/* Sync, M2 (1.3.1): Settings > Export Data, restoring a backup that names an account (or none),
   and the hand-over step before a restore leaves another account's changes behind
   (RestoreHandoverView). */
"Restore as It Was" = "按原样恢复";
"This backup is from another account. Its habits will be added to this account as new copies." = "此备份来自另一个账户。其中的习惯将作为新副本添加到此账户。";
"This backup is from another account (%@). Its habits will be added to this account as new copies." = "此备份来自另一个账户（%@）。其中的习惯将作为新副本添加到此账户。";
"This backup doesn't say which account it came from. If it's this account's own backup, restore it as it was; otherwise restore it as new copies." = "此备份没有记录来自哪个账户。如果是此账户自己的备份，请按原样恢复；否则请恢复为新副本。";
"This backup doesn't say which account it came from. If you'll sign in to that account on this device, restore it as it was; otherwise restore it as new copies." = "此备份没有记录来自哪个账户。如果你将在此设备上登录那个账户，请按原样恢复；否则请恢复为新副本。";
"This backup is from a Stride account. If you'll sign in to that account on this device, restore it as it was; otherwise restore it as new copies." = "此备份来自一个 Stride 账户。如果你将在此设备上登录那个账户，请按原样恢复；否则请恢复为新副本。";
"This backup is from %@. If you'll sign in to that account on this device, restore it as it was; otherwise restore it as new copies." = "此备份来自 %@。如果你将在此设备上登录那个账户，请按原样恢复；否则请恢复为新副本。";
"The recovered edits on this device are erased too. Export them first if you might need them." = "此设备上找回的编辑也会被抹掉。如果之后可能需要，请先导出。";
"Before You Restore" = "恢复之前";
"This device still holds changes from another account that restoring this backup leaves behind." = "此设备上仍有另一个账户的更改，恢复此备份后这些更改将被搁置。";
"This device still holds changes from %@ that restoring this backup leaves behind." = "此设备上仍有 %@ 的更改，恢复此备份后这些更改将被搁置。";
"If you restore, the deletions are dropped, and the recovered edits are shown again only when that account uses this device. To send the deletions instead, cancel, sign in to that account and sync first." = "如果恢复，这些删除将被丢弃，找回的编辑只有在那个账户使用此设备时才会再次显示。若要发送这些删除，请取消，登录那个账户并先同步。";
